      "name": "Criar Issue",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-publish",
      "description": "A única ação que publica; verde merge no rodapé do draft.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-publish\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 .5a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.41c.58.1.79-.25.79-.56v-2.02c-3.2.7-3.88-1.37-3.88-1.37-.52-1.33-1.28-1.69-1.28-1.69-1.05-.71.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.19-3.09-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.17 1.18a11 11 0 0 1 5.77 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.83 1.19 3.09 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.26 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14v3.17c0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5Z\"/></svg>Criar Issue</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-publish{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--lane-merge,#12805a);color:var(--ground,#eceef1);font:600 14px/1 Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;box-shadow:var(--shadow-raised,0 1px 2px rgb(20 22 27/.06),0 8px 24px -12px rgb(20 22 27/.18));transition:filter .2s,transform .2s;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-publish:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}.ds-btn-publish:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn-publish:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--lane-project,#2446d8);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Continuar com GitHub",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Botão primário em tinta; entrada do login.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">Continuar com GitHub</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;height:48px;padding:0 20px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--ink,#14161b);color:var(--ground,#eceef1);font:500 15px/1 Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;box-shadow:var(--shadow-raised,0 1px 2px rgb(20 22 27/.06),0 8px 24px -12px rgb(20 22 27/.18));transition:background-color .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),transform .2s;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink,#14161b) 90%,transparent)}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--lane-project,#2446d8);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
